{
  "$schema": "./codex_upgrade_evidence_labels.schema.json",
  "schema_version": "codex-upgrade-evidence-labels/v1",
  "codex_version": "0.145.0",
  "description": "把每个 capture job 的证据子路径映射到冻结场景、artifact kind、parser 与实验条件标签。标签描述的是采集时就已确定的实验条件（CA 模式、协议面、residency 等），不是对证据内容的观测结论；编目器只按本声明贴标签，禁止读取文件内容决定任何字段。",
  "authority": [
    "labels 必须能由 job 的采集参数与场景 precondition 推出，不得由被该标签选中的判据所验证的属性反推——否则判据退化为同义反复。",
    "同一原始文件在 manifest 中只能二选一：以原生 parser 直接解析，或以 opaque_bound_source 登记并由 ACC-02b 派生器产出结构化观测。",
    "本声明随场景清单在 plan 阶段冻结摘要；任何修改都必须重新审核并重建 Campaign。"
  ],
  "entries": [
    {
      "job_id": "official-core",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "direct/codex-http/*/traffic.pcap",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A01"
          ],
          "kind": "pcap",
          "parser": "pcap_client_hello",
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "ca_mode": "system",
            "surface": "codex-http"
          },
          "rationale": "direct 面未配置自定义 CA（A01 precondition），subject 为 codex-http，全部握手为 HTTP 出站栈。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "direct/codex-ws/*/traffic.pcap",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A02"
          ],
          "kind": "pcap",
          "parser": "pcap_client_hello",
          "labels": {
            "transport": "websocket",
            "ca_mode": "system",
            "surface": "codex-ws"
          },
          "rationale": "direct 面未配置自定义 CA，subject 为 codex-ws。注意该 pcap 同时含启动期 models 的 HTTP 握手，判据缺陷见 SPEC_TLS_003_JUDGMENT_DEFECT.md。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "mitm/codex-http/*/codex-http.jsonl",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "wire_dump",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "mitm_http_jsonl",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "ca_mode": "custom",
            "surface": "codex-http",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "mitm 面经受控 CA 解密，subject codex-http 的 Responses 出站；由派生器投影为 wire 观测。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "mitm/codex-http/*/models-http.jsonl",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "wire_dump",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "mitm_http_jsonl",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "ca_mode": "custom",
            "surface": "models",
            "endpoint_class": "auxiliary",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "models 端点属辅助出站面（endpoint_class=auxiliary），与 Responses 主链路分开登记。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "mitm/codex-http/*/models-http.jsonl",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A01"
          ],
          "kind": "wire_dump",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "mitm_http_jsonl",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "ca_mode": "custom",
            "surface": "models",
            "endpoint_class": "auxiliary",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "A01 的 models 请求明文观测：official-core 无字节中继，由 mitm 面同一份 models-http.jsonl 经派生器投影为 process_trace。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "mitm/codex-ws/*/codex-http.jsonl",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A15"
          ],
          "kind": "wire_dump",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "mitm_http_jsonl",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "websocket",
            "ca_mode": "custom",
            "surface": "codex-ws",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "mitm 面 codex-ws subject 的握手与升级请求。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-ws-handshake-repeat",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "direct/codex-ws/*/traffic.pcap",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A02"
          ],
          "kind": "pcap",
          "parser": "pcap_client_hello",
          "labels": {
            "transport": "websocket",
            "ca_mode": "system",
            "surface": "codex-ws"
          },
          "rationale": "A02 补采：独立 batch-id 重跑 codex-ws direct，把独立 WS 握手 artifact 数补足到 minimum_artifacts。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-http-response",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/conn001.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A01"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "surface": "models",
            "endpoint_class": "auxiliary",
            "provider": "openai_oauth",
            "variant": "no_cookie"
          },
          "rationale": "主线 job 固定 gpt-5.4；首个中继连接是启动期 models GET，为 A01 提供未经过 mitm 重构的 HTTP/1.1 原始请求行。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "relay/conn00[!1].client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A04"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth",
            "variant": "http_default"
          },
          "rationale": "主线模型条件收据证明 gpt-5.4 的 use_responses_lite=false；method/path selector 只会取 POST Responses，补齐 BODY-006 两个非 Lite 样本。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-http-response-plain",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/conn00[!12].client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A04"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "compression": "plain",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth",
            "variant": "http_default"
          },
          "rationale": "采集脚本以 --disable enable_request_compression 关闭 Stage::Stable 的压缩 feature，故本 job 的 Responses 请求体不带 content-encoding；compression=plain 由采集配置权威给出，不从被测 body 反推。这是 SPEC-BODY-002 responses-plain 唯一的负样本来源。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-lite-http-response",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/conn001.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A03"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "lite",
            "mode": "lite",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth",
            "variant": "no_cookie"
          },
          "rationale": "Lite 专项固定 gpt-5.6-luna；首个连接的 models GET 与模型条件收据共同证明 use_responses_lite=true。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "relay/conn003.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A03"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "lite",
            "mode": "lite",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth",
            "variant": "http_default"
          },
          "rationale": "Lite 专项第三个连接固定为 POST Responses；若连接顺序漂移，path/method selector 会失败关闭。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "relay/conn00[!13].client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A03"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "lite",
            "mode": "lite",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "收口 Lite 专项 conn001／conn003 之外的独立连接；标签来自 job 的冻结模型坐标与成功收据，不从被测 body 反推。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-residency-us",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A04"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "residency": "us",
            "variant": "default",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "本 job 显式以 US residency 分支触发，residency=us 由 job 参数决定。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-runtime-metrics",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A04"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "residency": "unset",
            "variant": "default",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "runtime metrics 分支不设置 residency，构成 A04 residency 判据的负例样本。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A06"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "websocket_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "websocket",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "variant": "runtime_metrics",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "A06 是非 Lite WS 会话；本 job 显式开启 runtime_metrics，只能作为条件头正例，禁止再冒充默认握手。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-oauth-refresh",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "direct/traffic.pcap",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A13"
          ],
          "kind": "pcap",
          "parser": "pcap_client_hello",
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "ca_mode": "system",
            "surface": "oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "A13 需 auth.openai.com 的刷新握手；relay 劫持不改变客户端填写的 SNI。"
        },
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A13"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "variant": "default",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "刷新请求的明文形态由字节中继记录。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-turnstate-compact",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "variant": "turn_state",
            "session_header_scope": "responses_or_compact",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "主线以 gpt-5.4 建立普通 WS turn，中继在 response.metadata 边界注入 turn-state；随后真实 legacy compact 必须自然回送第三槽。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-legacy-compact-default",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "variant": "default",
            "session_header_scope": "responses_or_compact",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "主线 gpt-5.4 的 legacy compact 默认槽位样本；模型条件收据必须证明 use_responses_lite=false，本样本不进入 Lite-only selector。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-lite-legacy-compact-default",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "lite",
            "mode": "lite",
            "variant": "default",
            "session_header_scope": "responses_or_compact",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "Lite 专项固定 gpt-5.6-luna，模型条件收据证明 use_responses_lite=true；仅本 track 可命中 EP-014 默认头序与 EP-020 默认 body 子集。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-lite-ws-turnstate",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A05"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "websocket_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "websocket",
            "track": "lite",
            "mode": "lite",
            "variant": "turn_state",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "A05 唯一的证据来源：Lite 专项固定 gpt-5.6-luna，模型条件收据证明 use_responses_lite=true；两轮 WS 会话由中继在 response.metadata 边界回送 turn-state，permessage-deflate 由握手自身协商。此前 A05 曾被绑在主线 turnstate-compact 上并标 mode=lite——那个条件从未成立，R8 撤销后 A05 一度失去全部证据，本 job 补回。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-legacy-compact-beta",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "variant": "beta",
            "session_header_scope": "responses_or_compact",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "legacy compact beta 槽位样本：采集脚本在关闭 remote_compaction_v2 的同时打开 network_proxy（0.147 与 0.145 唯一的 Stage::Experimental feature），使 x-codex-beta-features 出现在第三槽。属 I 类且与 0.145 基线同款条件，非本次新增干预；network_proxy 只作用于沙箱，不改 API 出站路径。本 job 走主线 {model}=gpt-5.4，上游 models 元数据给出 use_responses_lite=false，故 mode 只能是 non_lite。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-ws-default",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A06"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "websocket_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "websocket",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "variant": "default",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "独立默认 WS 样本不开 runtime_metrics、不注入头、不切 provider，专门承担 SPEC-WS-002 default-swap-remove-order。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-ws-optional-missing",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A06"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "websocket_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "websocket",
            "track": "main",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "variant": "optional_missing",
            "compression": "zstd",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "WS 可选头缺失扰动样本：采集脚本以 --disable remote_compaction_v2 关闭该 Stable feature，使 x-codex-beta-features 整条从握手中消失（该头只收录 Stage::Experimental feature 或 RemoteCompactionV2，后者 default_enabled=true 故默认存在）。变体由采集配置固定，非观测结论。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-image",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A03",
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "endpoint_class": "images",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "生图端点属 images 出站面，由 job 目标端点决定。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-image-edit",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A03",
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
          "labels": {
            "transport": "http",
            "endpoint_class": "images",
            "mode": "non_lite",
            "body_length": "automatic",
            "provider": "openai_oauth"
          },
          "rationale": "图片编辑复用 images 出站面。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "job_id": "official-relay-search",
      "side": "official",
      "rules": [
        {
          "glob": "relay/*.client_to_upstream.bin",
          "scenario_ids": [
            "A09"
          ],
          "kind": "relay_binary",
          "parser": "opaque_bound_source",
          "derive": {
            "parser": "h1_request_stream",
            "kind": "process_trace"
          },
